              <Criterion #P1-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0SSK5BEXC2A0MVH4ED8J3HG>
              Internal dependencies are exact; the product has no registry override, source/file substitute, old runtime duplicate or DB/DEPA-ORM package in the local File-XNL runtime closure.
              </?01M0SSK5BEXC2A0MVH4ED8J3HG>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task #P1-T2 { name = "prove all upstream releases from a fresh registry closure" status = "DONE" order = 1 } (
