              <Criterion #P2-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M0SSK5BEXC2A0MVH4ED8J3HJ>
              HolonCoordinator assigns the ready task to an eligible MemberRuntime; TaskSpace settles before a separate Flow checkpoint CAS consumes the durable receipt.
              </?01M0SSK5BEXC2A0MVH4ED8J3HJ>
              <Criterion #P2-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M0SSK5BFT2X0JX3MS1BD93QT>
              Repeated request is idempotent and reuses the default MemberRuntime without creating a second task settlement.
              </?01M0SSK5BFT2X0JX3MS1BD93QT>
